```{=html}
<div class="np-grid">
  <% for (const item of items) { %>
    <div class="np-tile">
      <h3><%= item.title %></h3>
      <% if (item.description) { %><p><%= item.description %></p><% } %>
      <a class="tk-btn tk-btn-primary" href="<%= item.path %>">Learn more →</a>
    </div>
  <% } %>
</div>
```
